  "content": {
    "title": "西藏自治区日喀则市教育系统教师人才招聘信息",
    "source": "",
    "publishDate": "2017-11-13",
    "bodyHtml": "\n                        <div class=\"mainlist bor\">\n            <h5>\n                <div class=\"ttt text20\">\n                    就业动态</div>\n            </h5>\n            <div>\n                <div class=\"titles\">\n                    <span id=\"lblTitle\" style=\"display:inline-block;\"><b><font size=\"5\">西藏自治区日喀则市教育系统教师人才招聘信息</font></b></span>\n                </div>\n                <div class=\"xian2\">\n                </div>\n                <div class=\"Issues\">\n                    <span id=\"lblIssue\" style=\"display:inline-block;\"><font size=\"3\">发布部门:日喀则市教育（体育）局   发布时间:2017-11-13 15:28:27</font></span>\n                </div>\n               <div id=\"tdNewsContent\"><p style=\"text-align: justify; line-height: 39px; text-indent: 43px; -ms-text-justify: inter-ideograph;\">\n    <span style=\"font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; font-size: 21px;\">为促进日喀则市教育事业发展，改善教师队伍结构，</span><span style=\"font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; font-size: 21px;\">按照自治区统一部署，结合日喀则市教育系统实际，经自治区教育厅同意，</span><span style=\"font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; font-size: 21px;\">现发布2017年日喀则市教育系统人才引进公告。</span>\n</p>\n<p style=\"text-align: justify; line-height: 39px; text-indent: 43px; -ms-text-justify: inter-ideograph;\">\n    <span style=\"font-family: 黑体; font-size: 21px;\">一、日喀则市教育系统基本情况</span>\n</p>\n<p style=\"text-align: justify; line-height: 39px; text-indent: 43px; -ms-text-justify: inter-ideograph;\">\n    <span style=\"font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; font-size: 21px;\">日喀则市是西藏自治区第二大城市，面积18.2万平方公里，常住人口近82万人，海拔3800米。下辖桑珠孜区、白朗县、江孜县、南木林县等18个县区。</span>\n</p>\n<p style=\"text-align: justify; line-height: 39px; text-indent: 43px; -ms-text-justify: inter-ideograph;\">\n    <span style=\"font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; font-size: 21px;\">日喀则市现有各级各类学校497所，中等职业技术学校2所，高级中学8所，初级中学23所，小学224所（民办1所），特殊教育学校1所，幼儿园239所（民办3所）。在校生140747人。共有教职工10951人，专任教师</span><span style=\"text-indent: 42.66px; font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; font-size: 21.33px;\">9874</span><span style=\"text-indent: 43px; font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; font-size: 21px;\">人</span><span style=\"text-indent: 43px; font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; font-size: 21px;\">。</span>\n</p>\n<p style=\"text-align: justify; line-height: 39px; text-indent: 43px; -ms-text-justify: inter-ideograph;\">\n    <span style=\"font-family: 黑体; font-size: 21px;\">二、引进原则</span>\n</p>\n<p style=\"text-align: justify; line-height: 39px; text-indent: 43px; -ms-text-justify: inter-ideograph;\">\n    <span style=\"font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; font-size: 21px;\">严格按照急需实用、能力优先、注重成绩、好中选优的原则，引进紧缺学科专任教师。</span>\n</p>\n<p style=\"text-align: justify; line-height: 39px; text-indent: 43px; -ms-text-justify: inter-ideograph;\">\n    <span style=\"font-family: 黑体; font-size: 21px;\">三、引进条件</span>\n</p>\n<p style=\"text-align: justify; line-height: 39px; text-indent: 43px; -ms-text-justify: inter-ideograph;\">\n    <span style=\"font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; font-size: 21px;\">1.</span><span style=\"font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; font-size: 21px;\">热爱祖国，政治立场坚定，忠诚党的教育事业，</span><span style=\"font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; font-size: 21px; -ms-layout-grid-mode: line;\">坚决反对分裂，维护祖国统一和民族团结，</span><span style=\"font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; font-size: 21px;\">全面贯彻党和国家教育方针政策。</span>\n</p>\n<p style=\"text-align: justify; line-height: 39px; text-indent: 43px; -ms-text-justify: inter-ideograph;\">\n    <span style=\"font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; font-size: 21px;\">2.</span><span style=\"font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; font-size: 21px;\">热爱西藏，志愿服务西藏，具有吃苦奉献精神</span><span style=\"font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; font-size: 21px;\">。</span>\n</p>\n<p style=\"text-align: justify; line-height: 39px; text-indent: 43px; -ms-text-justify: inter-ideograph;\">\n    <span style=\"font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; font-size: 21px;\">3.</span><span style=\"font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; font-size: 21px;\">综合素质好，遵纪守法，学习成绩优良，获得相应的毕业证书和学位证书</span><span style=\"font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; font-size: 21px;\">。</span>\n</p>\n<p style=\"text-align: justify; line-height: 39px; text-indent: 43px; -ms-text-justify: inter-ideograph;\">\n    <span style=\"font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; font-size: 21px;\">4.</span><span style=\"font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; font-size: 21px;\">身体健康，能够适应高原环境和教师岗位要求。</span>\n</p>\n<p style=\"text-align: justify; line-height: 39px; text-indent: 43px; -ms-text-justify: inter-ideograph;\">\n    <span style=\"font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; font-size: 21px;\">5.2017</span><span style=\"font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; font-size: 21px;\">年毕业生或往届毕业生，大专、本科学历毕业生年龄要求30周岁以下，硕士研究生年龄要求35周岁以下。</span>\n</p>\n<p style=\"text-align: justify; line-height: 39px; text-indent: 43px; -ms-text-justify: inter-ideograph;\">\n    <span style=\"font-family: 黑体; font-size: 21px;\">四、引进规模及派遣去向</span>\n</p>\n<table width=\"574\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\">\n    <tbody>\n        <tr class=\"firstRow\" style=\"height: 54px;\">\n            <td width=\"73\" height=\"54\" style=\"padding: 0px 7px; border: 1px solid black; border-image: none;\">\n                <p style=\"text-align: center; line-height: 39px;\">\n                    <span style=\"font-family: 黑体; font-size: 21px;\">学段</span>\n &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;\n                </p>\n            </td>\n            <td width=\"142\" height=\"54\" style=\"border-width: 1px 1px 1px medium; border-style: solid solid solid none; border-color: black black black currentColor; padding: 0px 7px; border-image: none;\">\n                <p style=\"text-align: center; line-height: 39px;\">\n                    <span style=\"font-family: 黑体; font-size: 21px;\">科目</span>\n &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;\n                </p>\n            </td>\n            <td width=\"94\" height=\"54\" style=\"border-width: 1px 1px 1px medium; border-style: solid solid solid none; border-color: black black black currentColor; padding: 0px 7px; border-image: none;\">\n                <p style=\"text-align: center; line-height: 39px;\">\n                    <span style=\"font-family: 黑体; font-size: 21px;\">派遣去向</span>\n &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;\n                </p>\n            </td>\n            <td width=\"175\" height=\"54\" style=\"border-width: 1px 1px 1px medium; border-style: solid solid solid none; border-color: black black black currentColor; padding: 0px 7px; border-image: none;\">\n                <p style=\"text-align: center; line-height: 39px;\">\n                    <span style=\"font-family: 黑体; font-size: 21px;\">要求</span>\n &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;\n                </p>\n            </td>\n        </tr>\n        <tr style=\"height: 90px;\">\n            <td width=\"73\" height=\"90\" style=\"border-width: medium 1px 1px; border-style: none solid solid; border-color: currentColor black black; padding: 0px 7px; border-image: none;\">\n                <p style=\"text-align: center; line-height: 39px;\">\n                    <span style=\"font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; font-size: 20px;\">小学教师</span>\n &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;\n                </p>\n            </td>\n            <td width=\"142\" height=\"90\" style=\"border-width: medium 1px 1px medium; border-style: none solid solid none; border-color: currentColor black black currentColor; padding: 0px 7px;\">\n                <p style=\"text-align: center; line-height: 39px;\">\n                    <span style=\"font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; font-size: 20px;\">科目不限</span>\n &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;\n                </p>\n            </td>\n            <td width=\"94\" height=\"90\" style=\"border-width: medium 1px 1px medium; border-style: none solid solid none; border-color: currentColor black black currentColor; padding: 0px 7px;\">\n                <p style=\"text-align: center; line-height: 39px;\">\n                    <span style=\"font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; font-size: 20px;\">市区或所辖区、县</span>\n &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;\n                </p>\n            </td>\n            <td width=\"175\" height=\"90\" valign=\"top\" style=\"border-width: medium 1px 1px medium; border-style: none solid solid none; border-color: currentColor black black currentColor; padding: 0px 7px;\">\n                <p style=\"text-align: center; line-height: 39px;\">\n                    <span style=\"font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; font-size: 20px;\">本科及以上学历2017年应届及往届毕业生；到乡小学任教的可以放宽到大专学历。</span>\n &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;\n                </p>\n            </td>\n        </tr>\n        <tr style=\"height: 83px;\">\n            <td width=\"73\" height=\"83\" style=\"border-width: medium 1px 1px; border-style: none solid solid; border-color: currentColor black black; padding: 0px 7px; border-image: none;\">\n                <p style=\"text-align: center; line-height: 39px;\">\n                    <span style=\"font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; font-size: 20px;\">幼儿教师</span>\n &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;\n                </p>\n            </td>\n            <td width=\"142\" height=\"83\" style=\"border-width: medium 1px 1px medium; border-style: none solid solid none; border-color: currentColor black black currentColor; padding: 0px 7px;\">\n                <p style=\"text-align: center; line-height: 39px;\">\n                    <span style=\"font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; font-size: 20px;\">幼教</span>\n &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;\n                </p>\n            </td>\n            <td width=\"94\" height=\"83\" style=\"border-width: medium 1px 1px medium; border-style: none solid solid none; border-color: currentColor black black currentColor; padding: 0px 7px;\">\n                <p style=\"text-align: center; line-height: 39px;\">\n                    <span style=\"font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; font-size: 20px;\">市区或所辖区、县</span>\n &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;\n                </p>\n            </td>\n            <td width=\"175\" height=\"83\" valign=\"top\" style=\"border-width: medium 1px 1px medium; border-style: none solid solid none; border-color: currentColor black black currentColor; padding: 0px 7px;\">\n                <p style=\"text-align: center; line-height: 39px;\">\n                    <span style=\"font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; font-size: 20px;\">大专及以上学历2017年应届及往届毕业生。</span>\n &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;\n                </p>\n            </td>\n        </tr>\n    </tbody>\n</table>\n<p style=\"text-align: justify; line-height: 39px; text-indent: 43px; -ms-text-justify: inter-ideograph;\">\n    <span style=\"font-family: 黑体; font-size: 21px;\">五、引进流程</span>\n</p>\n<p style=\"text-align: justify; line-height: 39px; text-indent: 43px; -ms-text-justify: inter-ideograph;\">\n    <strong><span style=\"font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; font-size: 21px;\">（一）发布引进公告</span></strong>\n</p>\n<p style=\"text-align: justify; line-height: 39px; text-indent: 43px; -ms-text-justify: inter-ideograph;\">\n    <strong><span style=\"font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; font-size: 21px;\">（二）报名审查</span></strong>\n</p>\n<p style=\"text-align: justify; line-height: 39px; text-indent: 43px; -ms-text-justify: inter-ideograph;\">\n    <span style=\"font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; font-size: 21px;\">1.报名采取网上或现场报名两种方式，符合报名条件的应届毕业生将个人简历投寄至指定邮箱，简历投寄时间截止到2017年11月23日。\n</span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align: justify; line-height: 39px; text-indent: 43px; -ms-text-justify: inter-ideograph;\">\n    <span style=\"font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; font-size: 21px;\">面试时间、地点：另行通知</span>\n</p>\n<p style=\"text-align: justify; line-height: 39px; text-indent: 43px; -ms-text-justify: inter-ideograph;\">\n    <span style=\"font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; font-size: 21px;\">2.</span><span style=\"font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; font-size: 21px;\">收集整理审查报名信息和个人简历，符合条件的通知面试。</span>\n</p>\n<p style=\"text-align: justify; line-height: 39px; text-indent: 43px; -ms-text-justify: inter-ideograph;\">\n    <strong><span style=\"font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; font-size: 21px;\">（三）面试考察</span></strong>\n</p>\n<p style=\"text-align: justify; line-height: 39px; text-indent: 43px; -ms-text-justify: inter-ideograph;\">\n    <span style=\"font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; font-size: 21px;\">1.</span><span style=\"font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; font-size: 21px;\">对报名审查通过人员组织面试，考察综合素质，好中选优、优中选强。</span>\n</p>\n<p style=\"text-align: justify; line-height: 39px; text-indent: 43px; -ms-text-justify: inter-ideograph;\">\n    <span style=\"font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; font-size: 21px;\">面试需准备相关材料：个人简历1份，身份证、毕业证、学位证原件及复印件，学历电子注册备案表、教育部学籍在线验证报告，政审材料原件，取得教师资格人员带原件及复印件。</span>\n</p>\n<p style=\"text-align: justify; line-height: 39px; text-indent: 43px; -ms-text-justify: inter-ideograph;\">\n    <span style=\"font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; font-size: 21px;\">2.</span><span style=\"font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; font-size: 21px;\">验证收集面试合格人员佐证材料原件及复印件。</span>\n</p>\n<p style=\"text-align: justify; line-height: 39px; text-indent: 43px; -ms-text-justify: inter-ideograph;\">\n    <span style=\"font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; font-size: 21px;\">3.</span><span style=\"font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; font-size: 21px;\">当场得出面试结果，合格人员通知其体检。</span>\n</p>\n<p style=\"text-align: justify; line-height: 39px; text-indent: 43px; -ms-text-justify: inter-ideograph;\">\n    <strong><span style=\"font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; font-size: 21px;\">（四）自行体检</span></strong>\n</p>\n<p style=\"text-align: justify; line-height: 39px; text-indent: 43px; -ms-text-justify: inter-ideograph;\">\n    <span style=\"font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; font-size: 21px;\">自行安排体检，体检项目参照援藏干部进藏体检项目确定，重点检查心脏、肝脏、肺、血液等，费用自理（需三甲以上医院）。</span>\n</p>\n<p style=\"text-align: justify; line-height: 39px; text-indent: 43px; -ms-text-justify: inter-ideograph;\">\n    <strong><span style=\"font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; font-size: 21px;\">（五）签订意向协议</span></strong>\n</p>\n<p style=\"text-align: justify; line-height: 39px; text-indent: 43px; -ms-text-justify: inter-ideograph;\">\n    <span style=\"font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; font-size: 21px;\">1.</span><span style=\"font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; font-size: 21px;\">与体检合格人员签订意向协议（一式四份），收集毕业证、学位证。</span>\n</p>\n<p style=\"text-align: justify; line-height: 39px; text-indent: 43px; -ms-text-justify: inter-ideograph;\">\n    <span style=\"font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; font-size: 21px;\">2.</span><span style=\"font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; font-size: 21px;\">询问、登记合格人员档案所在地，准备进行调档。</span>\n</p>\n<p style=\"text-align: justify; line-height: 39px; text-indent: 43px; -ms-text-justify: inter-ideograph;\">\n    <strong><span style=\"font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; font-size: 21px;\">（六）调档审核</span></strong>\n</p>\n<p style=\"text-align: justify; line-height: 39px; text-indent: 43px; -ms-text-justify: inter-ideograph;\">\n    <span style=\"font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; font-size: 21px;\">由自治区教育厅委托相关省(市、自治区)省教育厅（教委）协助开展调档工作，由工作组分批寄回，报请西藏自治区教育厅、人社厅审核。</span>\n</p>\n<p style=\"text-align: justify; line-height: 39px; text-indent: 43px; -ms-text-justify: inter-ideograph;\">\n    <strong><span style=\"font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; font-size: 21px;\">（七）正式报到</span></strong>\n</p>\n<p style=\"text-align: justify; line-height: 39px; text-indent: 43px; -ms-text-justify: inter-ideograph;\">\n    <span style=\"font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; font-size: 21px;\">人员档案审核通过后，通知引进人员到日喀则市教育局指定地点正式报到，签订正式就业协议。由区人社厅—区教育厅—市教育局—县教育局—学校层层派遣到岗。</span>\n</p>\n<p style=\"text-align: justify; line-height: 39px; text-indent: 43px; -ms-text-justify: inter-ideograph;\">\n    <span style=\"font-family: 黑体; font-size: 21px;\">六、相关政策</span>\n</p>\n<p style=\"text-align: justify; line-height: 39px; text-indent: 43px; -ms-text-justify: inter-ideograph;\">\n    <span style=\"font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; font-size: 21px;\">1.</span><span style=\"font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; font-size: 21px;\">引进人才实行试用期制度，试用期1年，试用期工资按试用期满后工资确定。考核合格任职定级后，正式录用为日喀则市教师，纳入国家事业编制，享受日喀则市正式教师同等工资、医疗及带薪年假等待遇。</span>\n</p>\n<p style=\"text-align: justify; line-height: 39px; text-indent: 43px; -ms-text-justify: inter-ideograph;\">\n    <span style=\"font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; font-size: 21px;\">2.</span><span style=\"font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; font-size: 21px;\">工资待遇。日喀则市新入职正式教师专科 7925 元/月、本科 8114 元/月、硕士研究生 9090 元/月。</span>\n</p>\n<p style=\"text-align: justify; line-height: 39px; text-indent: 43px; -ms-text-justify: inter-ideograph;\">\n    <span style=\"font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; font-size: 21px;\">3.</span><span style=\"font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; font-size: 21px;\">各接收学校根据实际情况为引进人才安排住房。</span>\n</p>\n<p style=\"text-align: justify; line-height: 39px; text-indent: 43px; -ms-text-justify: inter-ideograph;\">\n    <span style=\"font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; font-size: 21px;\">4.</span><span style=\"font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; font-size: 21px;\">引进人才工作未满8年离开西藏的，取消录用资格，并按相关协议退还相关费用。</span>\n</p>\n<p style=\"text-align: justify; line-height: 39px; text-indent: 43px; -ms-text-justify: inter-ideograph;\">\n    <span style=\"font-family: 黑体; font-size: 21px;\">七、联系方式</span>\n</p>\n<p style=\"text-align: justify; line-height: 39px; text-indent: 43px; -ms-text-justify: inter-ideograph;\">\n    <span style=\"font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; font-size: 21px;\">投档邮箱：903995581@qq.com</span>。\n</p>\n<p style=\"text-align: justify; line-height: 39px; text-indent: 43px; -ms-text-justify: inter-ideograph;\">\n    <span style=\"font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; font-size: 21px;\">特此公告。</span>\n</p>\n<p>\n    &nbsp;\n</p></div>\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"xian2\">\n            </div>\n            <table width=\"100%\">\n                <tbody><tr>\n                    <td width=\"10%\" height=\"23\" bgcolor=\"#FFFFFF\" align=\"right\">\n                        附件：\n                    </td>\n                    <td>\n                        &nbsp;\n                    </td>\n                </tr>\n                <tr>\n                    <td>\n                        &nbsp;\n                    </td>\n                    <td width=\"90%\" height=\"23\" align=\"left\" bgcolor=\"#FFFFFF\">\n                        \n                    </td>\n                </tr>\n            </tbody></table>\n        </div>\n                    ",
